=============================
Git Cleanup and Push Exercise
=============================

Step 1: Verify Master is in Clean State

git checkout master
git status


=============================
Step 2: List All Available Branches
=============================

git branch -a


=============================
Step 3: Pull Latest Changes from Remote Repository
=============================

git pull origin master


=============================
Step 4: Push Pending Changes to Remote Repository
=============================

git push origin master


=============================
Step 5: Verify Changes in Remote Repository
=============================

Open GitLab Repository

Repository -> Files

OR

Repository -> Commits

Verify that the latest commit is available in the remote repository.
